# tally 2.2.1 P43 S4 (E §4.2: a read of day t reads its prefix through t): a false when of a movement
# dated after the read's last day isn't in its set (review g2fix reg/r2_when_before). A guard: refcore so.
=== r2_when_before.tally
model r2
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input on_: bool
input pay: money PLN
input w: date
move pw: transfers
  on w
  when on_
  leg cash from world to konto amount pay
version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  pay = 100.00 PLN "s"
  on_ = true "s"
  w = 2026-03-10 "s"
ask t_before: bal(konto, 2026-02-01) with on_ = true
ask f_before: bal(konto, 2026-02-01) with on_ = false
ask t_fl: flows(konto, 2026-02) with on_ = true
ask f_fl: flows(konto, 2026-02) with on_ = false
ask f_flm: flows(pw, 2026-02) with on_ = false
ask t_flm: flows(pw, 2026-02) with on_ = true
ask f_cnt: count(m in transfers over 2026-02) with on_ = false
=== expect
f_before: 500.00 PLN
  cut 2026-01-01
f_cnt: 0
  pinned: on_ = false
  cut 2026-01-01
f_fl: 0.00 PLN
  cut 2026-01-01
f_flm: 0.00 PLN
  cut 2026-01-01
t_before: 500.00 PLN
  cut 2026-01-01
t_fl: 0.00 PLN
  cut 2026-01-01
t_flm: 0.00 PLN
  cut 2026-01-01
